epos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-5693](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5693)\r\n### Description\n\n**Version**: `2.17.2.0-b151`\r\n\r\n**Steps**:\r\n1. Create a universe with RPC, packed columns and automatic tablet splitting enabled\r\n```\r\nm_flags = {\r\n            \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting\": \"true\",\r\n            \"tablet_split_high_phase_shard_count_per_node\": 200,\r\n            \"tablet_split_high_phase_size_threshold_bytes\": 102400,  # 100 KB\r\n            \"tablet_split_low_phase_size_threshold_bytes\": 10240,  # 10 KB\r\n            \"tablet_split_low_phase_shard_count_per_node\": 16,\r\n            \"tablet_split_limit_per_table\": 512,\r\n            \"enable_stream_compression\": \"true\",\r\n            \"stream_compression_algo\": 3,\r\n            \"ysql_enable_packed_row\": \"true\",\r\n        }\r\n        t_flags = {\r\n            \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting\": \"true\",\r\n            \"yb_num_shards_per_tserver\": 1,\r\n            \"ysql_num_shards_per_tserver\": 1,\r\n            \"enable_stream_compression\": \"true\",\r\n            \"stream_compression_algo\": 3,\r\n            \"ysql_enable_packed_row\": \"true\",\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n2. Create a colocated database and non colocated databases\r\n3. Create tables, optout tables\r\n4. Enable PITR: Create a snapshot schedule(on non-colocated DB)\r\n5. Record current timestamp t1\r\n6. Perform below steps for both colocated and non colocated tables\r\n7. Insert some data(20K) into tables and validate data, tablets\r\n8. Take backup(b1) \r\n9. Delete some data from tables and observe the tablet counts\r\n10. Restore to t1 and observe the tablet counts, load some more data\r\n11. Copy data from table into a file 'f1'\r\n12. Delete all rows from table\r\n13. Copy data from 'f1' into table and validate\r\n14. Record current timestamp t2\r\n15. Start workload and do following when the splitting is in progress\r\n    1. Alter table add a column\r\n    2. Alter table drop a column\r\n16. Validate data and observe the tablet counts\r\n17. Restore to t2\r\n\r\n**Observations**:\r\n1 . At step#17 - it is timing out(PITR is timing out)\r\n2. While running this scenario manually, some basic select queries are timing out after step#10. After some time those queries are working fine.\n\n[DB-5693]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5693?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/16268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/16268/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":8937653004,"node_id":"AE_lADOBlCVUc5ihZ5PzwAAAAIUucMM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/8937653004","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-04-05T17:23:41Z","assignee":{"login":"SrivastavaAnubhav","id":17299377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjk5Mzc3","avatar_url":"https://a